WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:09.407
Job two: take care of your people. People stay, and do their best work, for a manager who notices them.

2
00:00:09.457 --> 00:00:10.416
Four habits.

3
00:00:10.466 --> 00:00:19.661
Listen and help: move what you can, and send anything that sounds like leave to the leave office the same day.

4
00:00:19.711 --> 00:00:23.947
Grow them: one assignment a quarter that stretches.

5
00:00:23.997 --> 00:00:32.016
Thank them: specific, by name, that week. Trust them: hand over the decision, not just the task.

6
00:00:32.066 --> 00:00:36.303
This week, thank one person for one specific thing.

